What OSF Version?
For Digital Unix 4.0b (and probably all higher versions) you
have to check and probably increase the kernel parameters
dfldsiz (Default data segment size limit) 
maxdsiz
dflssiz (Default stack size limit) 
maxssiz
and build a new kernel.
For us increasing dfldsiz is sufficient.

