Dear  Vladimir,

	To switch the default visual from PseudoColor to Truecolor, copy
your /usr/dt/config/Xservers file to /etc/dt/config/Xservers (creating
/etc/dt/config if it does not exist yet) and modifiy the X Server startup
command in this file to include the options:

        -vclass0 TrueColor -depth xx

where XX can be 16 or 24.  

Other useful switches are  :   -screen 1280    -terminate


Yours, Hans.
