version 5.0 but you can use it in former releases too.)

Edit the /etc/doprc file:

global_admin {
                        {users {root user1 user2 }}
                        {groups {      }}
}

the user1 and user2 will have privilege to run all comands listed in
this file that contain a valid path.

to run shutdown comand as user1 use:

#dop shutdown ....

Cheers, Igor

