>> deletions, and so on. For example, the original Mach VM
>> has been largely replaced. And in more recent versions,
>> the Mach interface to the threads library has been
>> completely bypassed. But deep down inside the kernel,
>> you'll still find the guts of Mach IPC and kernel threads there.
