>

There are no real advantages, and some distinct disadvantages.
The most notable disadvantage is support. Those pure Mach
interfaces aren't really supported, and there have never
been any guarantees that they'll still work as documented
by CMU. They can be fun to play around with, but I wouldn't
build any software you expect to support on them.

Jeff




